---@field territory? LuaTerritory
---A unique number identifying this unit for the lifetime of the save. These are allocated sequentially and not re-used (until overflow). These numbers are allocated from the same pool as [LuaEntity::unit\_number](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/classes/LuaEntity.html#unit_number), so segmented unit numbers are unique among all segmented units and all entities with owners.
